OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786544309
OL,3,CNine households volunteer to have
OL,4,Ctheir gardens excavated in
OL,5,Carchaeological dig
OL,7,FNine households have volunteered to
OL,8,Fhave their gardens dug up as part of a
OL,9,Fcommunity archaeology project.
OL,11,FLocals in the village of Nenthead are
OL,12,Ffinding memories of a past lying just
OL,13,Fbeneath its surface.
OL,15,FArchaeologist Colin Elder is looking
OL,16,Fto explore the history of the local
OL,17,Farea and the led mining past
OL,18,Fconnections with the village.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/5
