PN,32802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786544309
OL,3,CNine households volunteer to have
OL,4,Ctheir gardens excavated in
OL,5,Carchaeological dig
OL,7,FHe said: "We are hoping to find
OL,8,Fanything that tells us a bit more
OL,9,Fabout miners lives and miners families
OL,10,Flives.
OL,12,F"The North Pennines area is associated
OL,13,Fwith led mining and in Nenthead where
OL,14,Fwe are. What we are trying to
OL,15,Fascertain now is the stories behind
OL,16,Fthe mines, the people and the lived
OL,17,Fexperiences."
OL,19,FFor landowner Cath Blackfeather it is
OL,20,Fan opportunity to find out more about
OL,21,Fthe land she owns.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786544309
OL,3,CNine households volunteer to have
OL,4,Ctheir gardens excavated in
OL,5,Carchaeological dig
OL,7,FShe said: "I live here and it is
OL,8,Fobviously an old place and I am
OL,9,Finterested in history and archaeology.
OL,10,FI think when you live in a place you
OL,11,Fwant to know more about it."
OL,13,FRebecca Cadbury-Simmons from North
OL,14,FPennines National Landscape said: "It
OL,15,Fis a really tangible way to interact
OL,16,Fwith the past, particularly with an
OL,17,Farchaeology dig like this.
OL,26,@vD@cOU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/5
