CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786544309
OL,3,CNine households volunteer to have
OL,4,Ctheir gardens excavated in
OL,5,Carchaeological dig
OL,7,FIt helps place what they see around
OL,8,Fthem in the landscape in the context
OL,9,Fof these were real lives and real
OL,10,Fpeople who lived here before us."
OL,12,FArchaeologist Colin Elder added: "A
OL,13,Ffew of the finds will be going upon
OL,14,Fdisplay publicly. We have also offered
OL,15,Fthe land owners some finds if they
OL,16,Fwant to keep it for themselves.
OL,18,FThere may be people with stuff in
OL,19,Ftheir back gardens that they weren't
OL,20,Feven aware of."
